  "Waiting for the disassembly of shader #%u...": "",
  "What it records: every descriptor bound to every draw and dispatch, the viewport and scissor, the vertex and index buffers, the render target set, the fixed function state of each pipeline, the resource barriers, and a GPU timestamp per command instead of per pass.\n\nWhat it cannot record: the contents of a Direct3D 12 descriptor table, which is bound by handle and never handed to an add-on; and anything requiring replay, such as pixel history or re-running a draw, because CyGPUInspector observes the real frame rather than re-executing it on a device of its own.": "",
  "What you changed in the game, written down so it can be applied again without CyGPUInspector.": "",
